# outputs/*.jsonl is committed per spec (section 2) — do not ignore it.
# `modelbench smoke` writes here instead, never to outputs/ — never commit it.
.smoke_outputs/
# web/index.html is a BUILD OUTPUT (scripts_build_web_page.py embeds a
# results JSON into web/index.template.html) -- never commit it. Before
# Gate 1 the only results file that exists is results.sample.json
# (synthetic numbers, clearly marked), and committing the built page
# under the real production filename risks it being mistaken for real
# output sitting in the repo. Build it locally for dev preview:
#   python3 scripts_build_web_page.py --results results.sample.json --out web/index.html
web/index.html

# data/train.jsonl is a run-time cache of the Banking77 train split
# (downloaded on first run by src/modelbench/baseline.py). Owner decision
# 2026-09-17 (CONTEXT.md D28): data never goes to git; the test split
# data/golden.jsonl is the one committed exception.
data/train.jsonl
